:''Not to be confused with [[Demon Gory]].''
'''Aku Gory''' (ヘルゴリラー ''Herugorirā'', '''Hellgoriller''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Gory]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]], [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. He was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

