==Enemy==
Aku Gory has high health, insane DPS and fewer knockbacks than [[Gory Dark]] or [[Angelic Gory]], albeit slower than both variants. His [[Savage Blow]] ability only has a 10% chance to activate, but with his extreme damage, he can cause some serious disruption in your frontline, especially if you're unlucky enough that his Savage Blow actually hits your unwanted units.

==Strategy==
Aku Gory can easily push through your defenses, as his extreme DPS melts all units like a hot knife through butter, to the extent [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|specialized]] [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|anti-Aku]] [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|meatshields]] must be relied upon in a number of his appearances. Specialists able to counter him are few and far between since they are plagued with weaknesses that he can easily exploit, but brute force and the likes of [[Ancient Egg: N006 (Special Cat)|Fallen Bear Cat]]/[[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Bargain Cat]]/[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] can be viable responses to take him down quickly before he does too much damage. His low range also opens up the possibilities of using crowd-controllers that outrange him such as [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]], which can tremendously reduce the threat he poses.

